  "ruleText": "Mvi 208.18 Appeals. Any appeal shall be filed with the superior court within 30 days after the board rules on an application for rehearing, pursuant to RSA 357-C:12,VII.\n\nSource. #6980, eff 4-21-99, EXPIRED: 4-21-07\n\nNew. #8978, INTERIM, eff 9-14-07, EXPIRES: 3-12-08; ss by #9043-A, eff 11-29-07",
